DESCRIPTION:Bike lanes aren't just for bikes\; they’re mobility lanes. S
 afe\, connected infrastructure means access and independence for people of
  all abilities. Join Bike Brigade\, Cycle Toronto and the Kidical Mass TO 
 crew for the ACCESS FOR ALL ride on OCTOBER 31'st. Meetup at 10am at Chris
 tie Pits and rollout at 10:30am. We'll end the ride at Queen's Park with s
 peeches and and light snacks.\n\nDetails\n\n* Date: October 31\n* Time: 10
 :00 AM meet-up\, 10:30 AM roll out\n* Meeting Location: South East corner 
